.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-KEYBOARD 1
.Os @PROJECT_VERSION@

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-keyboard
.Nd configure keyboard shortcuts for the Lumina desktop.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It edits the key bindings used by the window manager in the Lumina
session.
.Pp
The Basic Editor lists each action with its current shortcut; a shortcut
can be changed or cleared.
The Advanced Editor shows the key binding file as plain text for direct
editing, and a reference of the binding syntax codes is available from the
menu.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-keyboard
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/fluxbox-keys
Key binding file used by
.Xr fluxbox 1
in the Lumina session.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lcc-window-manager 1 ,
.Xr fluxbox-keys 5

